  "id": "211536b21a4d94b84b1a661e",
  "title": "最近画的胖胖小可爱, 手绘记录",
  "summary": "之前由于我的手腕受伤，再加上伴侣的老母亲（伴侣的老母亲像个负能量的黑洞，看问题的角度总是负面而扭曲）住在我们这里，然后我心爱的小白猫又被村民们大量投放的剧毒鼠药毒死了，我整个人陷入了很压抑的状态。 那一阵子一想起我的小猫，就吧嗒吧嗒掉眼泪。我现在还有一只黑猫，我想这今后，我不再继续在这片到处是剧毒鼠药的土地上养新的小猫了。今后养个机器猫机器狗吧。 我花了很大的力气重建自己的创造力，有一阵子我拿着笔就发呆，不知道自己要画什么了。那一阵子我感觉自己的生命力是枯竭的，是干涸的。 但我不愿意一直这样枯萎下去。我于是开始记录每天做的菜，记录村里天天来我们院子里玩耍的狗，记录一些细枝末节的事情。随着琐碎记录的展开，我的生命力渐渐恢复了一部分。我终于又开始重新拿起笔，画画了。 不容易啊。朋友们。生命力坍塌起来速度惊人，恢复…",
  "content": "<p> </p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgj26ow7TXU8ocTADqaZvOapoKhGIygNhLvZKX1lIWhduzb-DzL1m_b1fneY_LWMTT5tVccjeOrIEgR98QUaW5LIQqg3az1uTi3c_sJvnlrkA3iWGtY9uekpmD31GHfGXOPHqNHBeYiMcMeem8FpMli-Gj3AEvXz1VvoB0ksCTbDrtqWPA2qPZGGbts2SGo/s1279/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260607151833_58_20.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgj26ow7TXU8ocTADqaZvOapoKhGIygNhLvZKX1lIWhduzb-DzL1m_b1fneY_LWMTT5tVccjeOrIEgR98QUaW5LIQqg3az1uTi3c_sJvnlrkA3iWGtY9uekpmD31GHfGXOPHqNHBeYiMcMeem8FpMli-Gj3AEvXz1VvoB0ksCTbDrtqWPA2qPZGGbts2SGo/w640-h360/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260607151833_58_20.png\" width=\"640\"></a></div><br><p></p><p><span><span>之前由于我的手腕受伤，再加上伴侣的老母亲（伴侣的老母亲像个负能量的黑洞，看问题的角度总是负面而扭曲）住在我们这里，然后我心爱的小白猫又被村民们大量投放的剧毒鼠药毒死了，我整个人陷入了很压抑的状态。</span></span></p><p><span><span>那一阵子一想起我的小猫，就吧嗒吧嗒掉眼泪。我现在还有一只黑猫，我想这今后，我不再继续在这片到处是剧毒鼠药的土地上养新的小猫了。今后养个机器猫机器狗吧。</span></span></p><p><span><span>我花了很大的力气重建自己的创造力，有一阵子我拿着笔就发呆，不知道自己要画什么了。那一阵子我感觉自己的生命力是枯竭的，是干涸的。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>但我不愿意一直这样枯萎下去。我于是开始记录每天做的菜，记录村里天天来我们院子里玩耍的狗，记录一些细枝末节的事情。随着琐碎记录的展开，我的生命力渐渐恢复了一部分。我终于又开始重新拿起笔，画画了。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>不容易啊。朋友们。生命力坍塌起来速度惊人，恢复起来却只能一点一点的进行。不过好歹我又重新开始画画啦。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>下面是个简单勾画的卷发女郎。我单纯喜欢画卷发。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEja_2zNazW0IxZnnURYhhWJ7RafieJTyik203WnZW-J8T2WtY56WvJXy4B1YlDgrYzNZKxoVp6KPuYMocGU0zYT44gVbtgwQ914H1Eha4N193jpdaZuijNiG6eP7bRkZp7RviScuEm5i-IMYZ-YnVqqbZuXjSEMMKFTm-AsFoRgOjA8KofRx7oLKHH6jkwG/s1280/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_2026-06-25_181805_827.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"440\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEja_2zNazW0IxZnnURYhhWJ7RafieJTyik203WnZW-J8T2WtY56WvJXy4B1YlDgrYzNZKxoVp6KPuYMocGU0zYT44gVbtgwQ914H1Eha4N193jpdaZuijNiG6eP7bRkZp7RviScuEm5i-IMYZ-YnVqqbZuXjSEMMKFTm-AsFoRgOjA8KofRx7oLKHH6jkwG/w640-h440/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_2026-06-25_181805_827.png\" width=\"640\"></a></span></span></span></div><span><span><span><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhV8RivCl4Qfe-cUs8Xuk9xala3jkYlLcqt8I0RIep5tuNC25uru7dRq2LTFYV5Gkhgxh3XZ3tWn_MMaWayE7DPmvwNm9cvoH5kX8gdgKCXdKioV9VvkzcU8Bk-eUdQcDejb4Cu_1YCbR8J94JdzVQB4TeUvwFXoVxKgF-Ny41i3JqXMJ-afLC_kWSkn8_V/s4000/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260603165621_41_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhV8RivCl4Qfe-cUs8Xuk9xala3jkYlLcqt8I0RIep5tuNC25uru7dRq2LTFYV5Gkhgxh3XZ3tWn_MMaWayE7DPmvwNm9cvoH5kX8gdgKCXdKioV9VvkzcU8Bk-eUdQcDejb4Cu_1YCbR8J94JdzVQB4TeUvwFXoVxKgF-Ny41i3JqXMJ-afLC_kWSkn8_V/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260603165621_41_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><span><span>然后呢，是画的一个胖兔兔。随着画胖兔兔的可爱笑脸，心情也随之变得毛茸茸的，轻松起来了。</span></span></span></span></span></span><p></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgZ56X56qgQkp3TIiuY_TZ3vIdca6SxGV2DhT_MUm4dEL4Nvsy19HkFhRlfIqv0vSTxCKHZ832am7pri0XOnD4HObJzpozwSbxsd_cTgxHEpCZKm1fSKEzJRMtc7Qtn3vfesBpy7KxNBq6AjwMkYWacbxlZqCAct1KvOM7-HZm_8FmU934Eqa-fXnnHHaAl/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260607131709_55_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgZ56X56qgQkp3TIiuY_TZ3vIdca6SxGV2DhT_MUm4dEL4Nvsy19HkFhRlfIqv0vSTxCKHZ832am7pri0XOnD4HObJzpozwSbxsd_cTgxHEpCZKm1fSKEzJRMtc7Qtn3vfesBpy7KxNBq6AjwMkYWacbxlZqCAct1KvOM7-HZm_8FmU934Eqa-fXnnHHaAl/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260607131709_55_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></span></span></span></div><span><span><span><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEggd1iVVHCAIKwHsJxJPoSPBxn3Ciib209xGAE3i75mxNAmlLyrQDwTRqLxID66gcd6_G-HleAa28YkPZuoIvniAY6Q-HdvAcp4dfN398pm-Vx8x-jRFVlYcqUSPTsDSn8QU0fhTiH7gc-XljuowB_ni38nXQKxg8mG1n2RzuIO5LVSLeKwRxP8kKoftAyb/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260607131708_54_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEggd1iVVHCAIKwHsJxJPoSPBxn3Ciib209xGAE3i75mxNAmlLyrQDwTRqLxID66gcd6_G-HleAa28YkPZuoIvniAY6Q-HdvAcp4dfN398pm-Vx8x-jRFVlYcqUSPTsDSn8QU0fhTiH7gc-XljuowB_ni38nXQKxg8mG1n2RzuIO5LVSLeKwRxP8kKoftAyb/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260607131708_54_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span><p></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>下面这张小画，是个戴胡萝卜项链的小羊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我专门给他画了长方形的横型瞳孔。确保他是个羊。我还给他画了黑色的指甲油，让他是个有点酷的可爱小羊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNzbU4T2iP-lDugqSBnlE8DVM7UjKLjl4i0yprqweQiHKNt8t2ZTWUYFP-KVYqVX3Qz_g92xb9TgXqvEDSvFrxp7LZ-ABoN_vx0j4LY4-g3E7N5C1SHYayMhABeUhHU8syvBEvg8iFI14Fzo-A1TbN2dB7rXybobJZuduT7oIdh4PbAPOQYKPhTpmbhqpl/s1279/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260613225606_115_20.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"362\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNzbU4T2iP-lDugqSBnlE8DVM7UjKLjl4i0yprqweQiHKNt8t2ZTWUYFP-KVYqVX3Qz_g92xb9TgXqvEDSvFrxp7LZ-ABoN_vx0j4LY4-g3E7N5C1SHYayMhABeUhHU8syvBEvg8iFI14Fzo-A1TbN2dB7rXybobJZuduT7oIdh4PbAPOQYKPhTpmbhqpl/w640-h362/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260613225606_115_20.png\" width=\"640\"></a></span></span></span></div><span><span><span><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3OYr7RFYtUA7MnddGj213ygg9cQHVXHRiq1IJcDS9PsNkhw95gq6oEnFH_e0s83SZLbD1lnAunhSGfArc3JK7jVpxlFIqiEC5_xc_kYI2A5-ee-FHu0KQj5ZDRQqgC75ZHsRhTA8XZ73LQLgjUTxSNeBubrAEBSEojHi_beU3ZjazwYR3No_sBuujhI83/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260613192444_114_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3OYr7RFYtUA7MnddGj213ygg9cQHVXHRiq1IJcDS9PsNkhw95gq6oEnFH_e0s83SZLbD1lnAunhSGfArc3JK7jVpxlFIqiEC5_xc_kYI2A5-ee-FHu0KQj5ZDRQqgC75ZHsRhTA8XZ73LQLgjUTxSNeBubrAEBSEojHi_beU3ZjazwYR3No_sBuujhI83/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260613192444_114_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span><p></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>绘画的过程还是记录在youtube了。有兴趣的朋友可以点过去看一眼：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RWhuRZ2FxVs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RWhuRZ2FxVs</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>好了，这就是最近画的一点小画了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>下次继续更新可爱的小动物画片儿。</span></span></p>",
